  "title": "Lumexa Imaging Advances Growth Strategy by Adding Four New Imaging Centers",
  "summary": "Lumexa Imaging (NASDAQ: LMRI), one of the nation’s largest providers of outpatient imaging services, today announced the addition of four new locations in 2026 as part of its continued execution against a disciplined, multi-channel growth strategy. The new centers are located in Spartanburg, South Carolina; Concord, North Carolina; Wexford, Pennsylvania; and Niceville, Florida.",
